    <h2>A programmer from the Tecklenburger Land</h2>
    <p>
        I am based in Ibbenbüren in the district of Steinfurt, between Osnabrück, Rheine and Münster. From here I
        work for companies all over Germany, and especially like working with clients from the immediate area: Ibbenbüren,
        Hörstel, Mettingen, Recke and Lotte, Osnabrück and the surrounding region, Rheine, Lingen and Münster.
    </p>
    <p>
        The advantage for you: a developer who programs your application personally and whom you can meet in
        person when needed, for example for the project kick-off or a workshop on your processes.
    </p>

    <h2>What I build for companies in the region</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Custom web applications</strong> when spreadsheets, paper or off-the-shelf software are no longer enough, for example for order, customer or appointment management. More under <a href="{{ path('app_service_symfony') }}">Symfony development</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Interfaces</strong> between inventory management, accounting, online shop and other systems so that data is not maintained twice. See <a href="{{ path('app_service_api') }}">API development</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Automation</strong> of invoices, reports and emails that are still created by hand today.</li>
        <li><strong>AI features</strong> such as reading invoices and PDFs or an assistant that knows your company. See <a href="{{ path('app_service_ai') }}">AI integration</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Takeover and maintenance</strong> of existing applications when the previous developer is no longer available. See <a href="{{ path('app_service_maintenance') }}">taking over Symfony projects</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Hosting, domains and email</strong> from one source, so you have a single point of contact for technical questions. See <a href="{{ path('app_service_hosting') }}">hosting</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>An example from practice</h2>
    <p>
        <a href="{{ path('app_reference_mirwena') }}">Mirwena</a> is a digital intake form for physiotherapy,
        osteopathy and occupational therapy practices. Patients fill it in on their own phone before the
        appointment, and the practice receives it complete and encrypted. Each practice has its own installation
        with its own database and key, and around 870 automated tests secure the application. That is the kind of
        software I build for small businesses: tailored to a specific workflow and safe with sensitive data.
    </p>

    <h2>How working together starts</h2>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Initial conversation</strong> by phone, video or at your premises: what is it about, what should improve?</li>
        <li><strong>Assessment and quote</strong>: you receive a transparent estimate, on a time-and-materials basis or at a fixed price.</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery in stages</strong>: you see first results early on a staging environment and give feedback.</li>
        <li><strong>Operations</strong>: on request I take care of updates, hosting and further development after launch.</li>
    </ol>

